    "profile_photo": "brandy_in_garden_aTZTYc2p04to.webp",
    "story": "Brandy was adopted by the Shakespeare family in June of 1984. She was a very lovely cat and was notable for being a great eater. One of her favourite pastimes was stealing food from people's dinner plates, particularly roast chicken, in which she would swiftly grab and immediately take outside before anyone could catch her. Brandy was a dearly loved cat, and is well remembered for not just her beautiful appearance but also her great character and calm temperament.",
